(7515659, 1200355, 123833, '<td valign="top">I thought the title said humility, I liked that</td>', 'I thought the title said humility, I liked that', '2017-05-26 13:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515668, 1200356, 163081, '<td valign="top">Majestic. Love the brightness of the feathers against the dark background and lake. This can make the cover of a book. A 10 from me.</td>', 'Majestic. Love the brightness of the feathers against the dark background and lake. This can make the cover of a book. A 10 from me.', '2017-05-26 14:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515675, 1200398, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely bird that I have never seen nor heard of, so you did me a big service there, thank you.  The photo''s pretty good, but given that the branches are totally nude I think I''d have preferred more tanager and less branches.  But who cares what I preferred?  You preferred it just like this which of course makes you right!  Thank you.</td>', 'This is a lovely bird that I have never seen nor heard of, so you did me a big service there, thank you.  The photo''s pretty good, but given that the branches are totally nude I think I''d have preferred more tanager and less branches.  But who cares what I preferred?  You preferred it just like this which of course makes you right!  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515676, 1200401, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the background, it''s a very suitable backdrop for the goose.  Pegleg himself is a handsome bird, well suited for monochrome.  Thank you.</td>', 'I like the background, it''s a very suitable backdrop for the goose.  Pegleg himself is a handsome bird, well suited for monochrome.  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 16:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515677, 1200351, 30364, '<td valign="top">He''s showing off. You are too. Both well justified.  Thank you.</td>', 'He''s showing off. You are too. Both well justified.  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515678, 1200403, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice pianissimo treatment that complements the loud parrot very well. Maybe it was caused by a partially obscured viewpoint for this frame, but you were perceptive enough to recognise it and make it work wonderfully.  Thank you.</td>', 'Very nice pianissimo treatment that complements the loud parrot very well. Maybe it was caused by a partially obscured viewpoint for this frame, but you were perceptive enough to recognise it and make it work wonderfully.  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 16:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515679, 1200391, 30364, '<td valign="top">Decisive moment though not for the fish I suppose.  Although on second thoughts what could be more decisive than death? It''s an unfamiliar point of view, head-on, and that makes it a more interesting photo still.  Thank you.</td>', 'Decisive moment though not for the fish I suppose.  Although on second thoughts what could be more decisive than death? It''s an unfamiliar point of view, head-on, and that makes it a more interesting photo still.  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 16:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515680, 1200257, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very appealing subject in an environmental portrait pose, and decent photography on your part. Nothing jaw-dropping about it, but jaws weren''t mentioned in the challenge description. Still, I always consider that part sort of implied. Nevertheless, it''s pretty and competent, so thank you.</td>', 'Very appealing subject in an environmental portrait pose, and decent photography on your part. Nothing jaw-dropping about it, but jaws weren''t mentioned in the challenge description. Still, I always consider that part sort of implied. Nevertheless, it''s pretty and competent, so thank you.', '2017-05-26 17:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515681, 1200399, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a pleasing sight, this minimalist, soaring picture.  I''m not sure the birds are soaring (they don''t look the type), but the picture is. A spiral that made me think of musical notation gone a bit renegade.  I like it very much for its anarchic spirit.  Can''t judge the photography because there isn''t enough of it present; that''s a welcome change from the more usual reverse case.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s a pleasing sight, this minimalist, soaring picture.  I''m not sure the birds are soaring (they don''t look the type), but the picture is. A spiral that made me think of musical notation gone a bit renegade.  I like it very much for its anarchic spirit.  Can''t judge the photography because there isn''t enough of it present; that''s a welcome change from the more usual reverse case.  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 17:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515682, 1200167, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s a very complete picture, ticks every box (pardon the pun).  It''s an interesting scene and very fine (if relentlessly conventional) photography.  Thank you.</td>', 'That''s a very complete picture, ticks every box (pardon the pun).  It''s an interesting scene and very fine (if relentlessly conventional) photography.  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515683, 1200355, 30364, '<td valign="top">A crowd pleaser.  His expression suggests that you owe him money. Nice separation from the background, though it does rob him of any context and so give him a bit of a caricature-ish quality.  But an amusing monkey, all the same.  Thank you.</td>', 'A crowd pleaser.  His expression suggests that you owe him money. Nice separation from the background, though it does rob him of any context and so give him a bit of a caricature-ish quality.  But an amusing monkey, all the same.  Thank you.', '2017-05-26 17:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515684, 1200305, 30364, '<td valign="top">Awesome to see a slug getting some well-deserved recognition!  Love that. Thank you.</td>', 'Awesome to see a slug getting some well-deserved recognition!  Love that. Thank you.', '2017-05-26 17:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515686, 1200369, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s magnificent.  Really, it is. The best one of these I have ever seen. Thank you.</td>', 'It''s magnificent.  Really, it is. The best one of these I have ever seen. Thank you.', '2017-05-26 17:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515739, 1200347, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Too pretty for my taste, but that''s not your fault.  It''s a clean, competent, unequivocal picture: all the things I don''t care for.  And yet ... it''s still really very nice indeed.  Charming, even.  Shows how little I know.  Thank you.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Too pretty for my taste, but that''s not your fault.  It''s a clean, competent, unequivocal picture: all the things I don''t care for.  And yet ... it''s still really very nice indeed.  Charming, even.  Shows how little I know.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 03:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515741, 1200379, 30364, '<td valign="top">Superb bird picture, framed absurdly well by the environmental ''props''.  I''m a raptor lover, and it''s a thrill to see this one depicted with such precision and understanding: not too close, because that loses the context; not too far away because ... well that part''s obvious. This way it tells me something intimate about the bird. Exceptional wildlife picture.  Thank you.</td>', 'Superb bird picture, framed absurdly well by the environmental ''props''.  I''m a raptor lover, and it''s a thrill to see this one depicted with such precision and understanding: not too close, because that loses the context; not too far away because ... well that part''s obvious. This way it tells me something intimate about the bird. Exceptional wildlife picture.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 03:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515742, 1200290, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very clean, crisp and unequivocal.  You can even see the mower scars on the grass blades.  That''s a remarkably sanguine wild rabbit to allow you to stalk it so closely.  Anyway, wild or not it''s a very competent photograph.  Thank you.</td>', 'Very clean, crisp and unequivocal.  You can even see the mower scars on the grass blades.  That''s a remarkably sanguine wild rabbit to allow you to stalk it so closely.  Anyway, wild or not it''s a very competent photograph.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 03:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515743, 1200349, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s not a processing treatment I enjoy, but the composition is perfect.  And the bird is a charmingly jaunty wee thing.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s not a processing treatment I enjoy, but the composition is perfect.  And the bird is a charmingly jaunty wee thing.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 03:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515744, 1200354, 30364, '<td valign="top">Raffa the Giraffa: took me a while to get it, alas. It''s a very nice giraffe picture; I''ve taken hundreds myself and never tire of it, nor of looking at giraffe photographs generally.  They are the supermodels of the bush; always posing and looking elegant.  One terrific bonus element of this picture to delight we serious giraffe artists is that the small foreground tree echoes the aspect of the giraffe''s body.  And that makes the picture much better for having the tree there  at least it does for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Raffa the Giraffa: took me a while to get it, alas. It''s a very nice giraffe picture; I''ve taken hundreds myself and never tire of it, nor of looking at giraffe photographs generally.  They are the supermodels of the bush; always posing and looking elegant.  One terrific bonus element of this picture to delight we serious giraffe artists is that the small foreground tree echoes the aspect of the giraffe''s body.  And that makes the picture much better for having the tree there  at least it does for me.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 03:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515747, 1200211, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great tones too!  Love that beautiful, rich caramel background which contrasts perfectly with the luminous white of the egret.  Also love the diffused reflection of the egret''s presence.  Really very nice.  Thank you.</td>', 'Great tones too!  Love that beautiful, rich caramel background which contrasts perfectly with the luminous white of the egret.  Also love the diffused reflection of the egret''s presence.  Really very nice.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 04:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515749, 1200219, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clear, crisp and a little bit of a caricature due to the lack of much environmental context. I''d have preferred a bit less squirrel and a bit more environment.  But who cares what I''d have preferred; it''s not my picture, it''s yours, and it''s undeniably a very competent one.  One big advantage of it being framed so closely is that I can more clearly see the irresistible resemblance to an American football lineman getting into a 3-point stance for the snap.  So, that''s an unexpected bonus!  I was wrong &amp; you were right.  Thank you.</td>', 'Clear, crisp and a little bit of a caricature due to the lack of much environmental context. I''d have preferred a bit less squirrel and a bit more environment.  But who cares what I''d have preferred; it''s not my picture, it''s yours, and it''s undeniably a very competent one.  One big advantage of it being framed so closely is that I can more clearly see the irresistible resemblance to an American football lineman getting into a 3-point stance for the snap.  So, that''s an unexpected bonus!  I was wrong & you were right.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 04:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515750, 1200362, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very clean picture of a nice heron (It is a heron, isn''t it? Which one?)  I think you have judged the depth of field, the extent of background blur, perfectly.  There''s enough information left back there for environmental context, but it''s unobtrusive enough to still throw the spotlight onto the subject.  It''s a very competent wildlife portrait.  Thank you.</td>', 'Very clean picture of a nice heron (It is a heron, isn''t it? Which one?)  I think you have judged the depth of field, the extent of background blur, perfectly.  There''s enough information left back there for environmental context, but it''s unobtrusive enough to still throw the spotlight onto the subject.  It''s a very competent wildlife portrait.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 04:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515752, 1200389, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Lovely colours, effective composition, perfectly well-judged focus &amp; depth of field.  You don''t need any advice from the likes of me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Very nice.  Lovely colours, effective composition, perfectly well-judged focus & depth of field.  You don''t need any advice from the likes of me.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 05:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515754, 1200294, 185757, '<td valign="top">Well timed capture. My top pick for this challenge.</td>', 'Well timed capture. My top pick for this challenge.', '2017-05-27 06:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515756, 1200341, 30364, '<td valign="top">Surely the moose is the world''s dopiest-looking creature?  But I probably misjudge them; they are probably clever and agile and climb up and down pine trees with ease.  This might be the nicest portrait of a moose that I''ve seen, with the animal nicely contrasted against the brush.  It''s quite flattering!  Thank you.</td>', 'Surely the moose is the world''s dopiest-looking creature?  But I probably misjudge them; they are probably clever and agile and climb up and down pine trees with ease.  This might be the nicest portrait of a moose that I''ve seen, with the animal nicely contrasted against the brush.  It''s quite flattering!  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 07:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515762, 1200222, 30364, '<td valign="top">Until having my curiosity stimulated by this photograph, I didn''t know that Arctic foxes exchange white fur for brown after winter.  That''s the test of any photograph''s merit for me: does it stimulate curiosity, interest and imagination?  Yours passes the test.  Plus as a bonus it''s an attractive, competent photograph. Thank you.</td>', 'Until having my curiosity stimulated by this photograph, I didn''t know that Arctic foxes exchange white fur for brown after winter.  That''s the test of any photograph''s merit for me: does it stimulate curiosity, interest and imagination?  Yours passes the test.  Plus as a bonus it''s an attractive, competent photograph. Thank you.', '2017-05-27 10:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515763, 1200294, 30364, '<td valign="top">Crikey!  Thank you.</td>', 'Crikey!  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 10:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515764, 1200377, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such wonderful knees!  This is a particularly interesting picture because of the two specimens are depicted doing different things.  So we see clearly what the bird looks like in the central version, and we see <i>why </i>it looks that way in the right-had version.  A wildlife photograph that reveals something interesting about the subject: isn''t that the genre''s ultimate <i>raison d''être</i>?  To which I say yep.  Thank you.</td>', 'Such wonderful knees!  This is a particularly interesting picture because of the two specimens are depicted doing different things.  So we see clearly what the bird looks like in the central version, and we see why it looks that way in the right-had version.  A wildlife photograph that reveals something interesting about the subject: isn''t that the genre''s ultimate raison d''être?  To which I say yep.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515765, 1200215, 30364, '<td valign="top">Maybe I haven''t been paying attention, but in spite of the many Komodo pictures I''ve seen before, this is the first time I have realised just how marked is the diagonally-opposite gait of this species.  Probably it looks so exaggerated because the legs go so far sideways when off the ground.  Illustrating that probably wasn''t your intention, but either way, thank you.</td>', 'Maybe I haven''t been paying attention, but in spite of the many Komodo pictures I''ve seen before, this is the first time I have realised just how marked is the diagonally-opposite gait of this species.  Probably it looks so exaggerated because the legs go so far sideways when off the ground.  Illustrating that probably wasn''t your intention, but either way, thank you.', '2017-05-27 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515766, 1200238, 30364, '<td valign="top">is beautiful<br/> <br/>thank you</td>', 'is beautiful thank you', '2017-05-27 11:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515779, 1200169, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see the squirrel among this tangle of bare branches.  Makes him seem a little ''wilder'' than the usual squirrel!  Thank you.</td>', 'Interesting to see the squirrel among this tangle of bare branches.  Makes him seem a little ''wilder'' than the usual squirrel!  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 15:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515780, 1200386, 30364, '<td valign="top">The egrets look spectacular against this dark backdrop.  Very nice wildlife picture. Thank you.</td>', 'The egrets look spectacular against this dark backdrop.  Very nice wildlife picture. Thank you.', '2017-05-27 15:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515781, 1200361, 30364, '<td valign="top">Perfect picture of the beautiful green-backed heron. These are among my favourite birds to observe, very skilful hunters with great patience and (as you say) stealth.  Superb wildlife picture.  Thank you.</td>', 'Perfect picture of the beautiful green-backed heron. These are among my favourite birds to observe, very skilful hunters with great patience and (as you say) stealth.  Superb wildlife picture.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 15:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515782, 1200390, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully confusing.  The ball is ... what?  Some kind of float?  I first though it was the moon from the thumbnail.  The heron, who is a grey heron I think, seems unimpressed by the ball.  The water is severely tilted and seems to be flowing uphill.  All in all, it''s a puzzle and I like that very much.  I''ll be trying again for sure.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is wonderfully confusing.  The ball is ... what?  Some kind of float?  I first though it was the moon from the thumbnail.  The heron, who is a grey heron I think, seems unimpressed by the ball.  The water is severely tilted and seems to be flowing uphill.  All in all, it''s a puzzle and I like that very much.  I''ll be trying again for sure.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 15:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515783, 1200356, 30364, '<td valign="top">Spectacular show by you and the bird both.  Swan?  Thank you.</td>', 'Spectacular show by you and the bird both.  Swan?  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 15:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515784, 1200169, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha! Perfect title!   And the Pose!   Ha! 7</td>', 'Hahahaha! Perfect title!   And the Pose!   Ha! 7', '2017-05-27 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515786, 1200344, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick for the challenge.  It''s more than just a portrait of wild animals; it''s about <i>who</i> they are, rather than simply what they look like.  That''s a dimension that is lamentably missing from so many wildlife portraits: the proper environmental context.  This spectacular environment is not just awe-inspiring to look at, it also tells the viewer a lot about the sheep; their life style, their adaption, what their physical skills must be like. Are they Dall sheep from around Denali perhaps?  The other possibility is Tibetan Argali sheep but that seems improbable.  My money''s on Alaska.  Really wonderful, absorbing wildlife photography.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is my top pick for the challenge.  It''s more than just a portrait of wild animals; it''s about who they are, rather than simply what they look like.  That''s a dimension that is lamentably missing from so many wildlife portraits: the proper environmental context.  This spectacular environment is not just awe-inspiring to look at, it also tells the viewer a lot about the sheep; their life style, their adaption, what their physical skills must be like. Are they Dall sheep from around Denali perhaps?  The other possibility is Tibetan Argali sheep but that seems improbable.  My money''s on Alaska.  Really wonderful, absorbing wildlife photography.  Thank you.', '2017-05-27 16:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515787, 1199954, 30364, '<td valign="top">Mad as can be.  I live that kind of madness. Thank you.</td>', 'Mad as can be.  I live that kind of madness. Thank you.', '2017-05-27 16:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515794, 1200389, 86447, '<td valign="top">I found a turtle... the only "wildlife" I found.   I tried to shoot him... It was awful.<br/> <br/>I''m so thankful that I didn''t enter the lame shot I got of him!  You''d have stomped the daylights out of my image!  Ha!<br/> <br/>Well done!!  7</td>', 'I found a turtle... the only "wildlife" I found.   I tried to shoot him... It was awful. I''m so thankful that I didn''t enter the lame shot I got of him!  You''d have stomped the daylights out of my image!  Ha! Well done!!  7', '2017-05-27 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
