(7516647, 1200294, 156466, '<td valign="top">Magnificent capture. Congrats on the Blue and your PB.<br/> <br/>Echoing a bit of what Lydia might have been going for, the only reason this wasn''t my #1 is that the background/OOF area seems to have suffered from the very processing that enhanced the subject. Had you been able to isolate the two and handle them separately this would be magazine cover worthy. Just food for thought in the future. Your alternate shots, while not as captivating, do a much better job of this.<br/> <br/>Again, well done.</td>', 'Magnificent capture. Congrats on the Blue and your PB. Echoing a bit of what Lydia might have been going for, the only reason this wasn''t my #1 is that the background/OOF area seems to have suffered from the very processing that enhanced the subject. Had you been able to isolate the two and handle them separately this would be magazine cover worthy. Just food for thought in the future. Your alternate shots, while not as captivating, do a much better job of this. Again, well done.', '2017-06-02 08:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
