(7517169, 1200294, 185793, '<td valign="top">wow... definitely a winning shot though I feel really sad for that turtle. But as you mentioned in your caption, it''s the circle of life. Love your thought process on your photo selection and I think the one with the muck gives greater impact. Looking forward to seeing more.</td>', 'wow... definitely a winning shot though I feel really sad for that turtle. But as you mentioned in your caption, it''s the circle of life. Love your thought process on your photo selection and I think the one with the muck gives greater impact. Looking forward to seeing more.', '2017-06-05 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 0),
